(1. Overview) Tj
T*
(Techtaru Digital Pvt. Ltd. is a GenAI engineering studio founded in) Tj
T*
(2019 and headquartered in Pune, India, with a second office in) Tj
T*
(Singapore. The company builds retrieval-augmented generation \(RAG\)) Tj
T*
(systems, voice agents and data pipelines for mid-size enterprises.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Key figures \(as of Q3 2025\)) Tj
T*
(- Employees: 84) Tj
T*
(- Clients: 37 active engagements across 6 countries) Tj
T*
(- Revenue FY2024: 14.2 crore INR \(about 1.7 million USD\)) Tj
T*
(- Revenue FY2023: 9.6 crore INR) Tj
T*
(- Average project duration: 11 weeks) Tj
T*
(- Offer letter turnaround: 5 working days) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Products) Tj
T*
(RAG-GPT is the flagship product: a document intelligence chat) Tj
T*
(service backed by LangChain and ChromaDB. VoiceBridge is a) Tj
T*
(multilingual AI voice agent. LedgerIQ is an automated invoice) Tj
T*
(reconciliation pipeline.) Tj
T*
ET
