(4. Hiring process) Tj
T*
(Stage 1: resume screening \(2 days\).) Tj
T*
(Stage 2: technical task - candidates build a small RAG pipeline) Tj
T*
(and are evaluated on their understanding of the vector search) Tj
T*
(internals, their handling of edge cases such as API rate limits) Tj
T*
(and empty queries, and the quality of their README documentation.) Tj
T*
(Stage 3: 45-minute system design interview.) Tj
T*
(Stage 4: founder chat and offer.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Employee benefits) Tj
T*
(- Annual learning budget: 60,000 INR per employee) Tj
T*
(- Flexible hours: 10:00 to 18:00 core overlap in IST) Tj
T*
(- Work-from-anywhere: up to 8 weeks per year) Tj
T*
(- Health insurance: family floater of 10 lakh INR) Tj
T*
(- Performance bonus: up to 15 percent of annual CTC) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Notice period) Tj
T*
(The standard notice period is 60 days; employees can negotiate a) Tj
T*
(buyout of 30 days of salary.) Tj
T*
